---@field containerRegistry? azure.redhatopenshift.ContainerRegistryProfile Azure Container Registry configuration for authenticating image pulls on the cluster's worker nodes.
---@field issuerUrl string URL for the OIDC provider to be used for authentication to authenticate against user Azure cloud account

